  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Southampton University genomf&#xf6;r 120 djupintervjuer med kubaner om deras minnen kring den kubanska revolutionen. Syftet &#xe4;r att uppmuntra offentlig debatt om revolutionens positiva och negativa sidor och om olika s&#xe4;tt att uppfatta samma sorts information/fr&#xe5;gest&#xe4;llning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southampton University is conducting 120 deep interviews with Cubans on their memories of the Cuban revolution. The purpose is to encourage a public debate on the achievements and failures of the revolution and of differences in perception on the same issue.</narrative>
  </description>
